+# Wire Serialisation Format
+
+No current decision is recorded in this project's documentation designating a single wire serialisation format; the existing docs (`docs/doc.md`) describe several supported response render formats (including JSON, XML, YAML, TOML, ProtoBuf, and MsgPack) without recording a choice of one as the project's standard.
